- [X] Fix ApproveMessage race (read-then-write): replace UpdateMessageStatus with an atomic *TransitionStatus(id, from, to)* using `UPDATE ... WHERE id = $2 AND status = $3`; on no rows, look up the message to return ErrNotFound vs ErrInvalidStatus
- [X] Idem for RejectMessage
- [X] Set approved_at / claimed_at / printed_at on the matching transitions
- [X] Add a RequeueMessage endpoint
- [X] Add printers's endpoints

